<title>HONG KONG: Wing Lung Bank 1996 net rises 18.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing Lung Bank 1996 net rises 18.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   445.4  vs  377.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    135.0  vs  112.5 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    861.82 vs  729.51</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing Lung Bank Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 16-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Wing Lung Bank is a banking and financial services company. It proposed a bonus issue of one-for-five shares held.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings and final dividend have been adjusted for the bonus issue in 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is HK$1.75 (including interim dividend of 40 cents) vs HK$1.46 (adjusted).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
